From b8b50cdc3548c482577da1b7abf7abab7f55ad98 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Strata Orin Port <orin-port@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 07:19:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] build: port the v0.1.45 CPU support layer to native ARM64

Adapt the ARM portions of calvinvette/strata-inference-orin 89489e996b79344d49165a1eb001c5ba1d28081e onto 477ac13c. Keep all x86 dispatch tiers including AVX1 and NVFP4. No CUDA kernel, quantization selection or prefill option is disabled. Portable Q2 and ggml ARM rows are CPU support, not a replacement for GPU inference.
